---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Newsletter from '../../components/Newsletter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Everyday AI Lab | Only about AI in real life"
  description="Only about AI in real life. Practical experiments for everyday humans. Learn about our mission and manifesto."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrl="/about"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#E05A2B] text-[#FAF7F2] text-xs font-mono font-bold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-3 shadow-2xs">
        <span>ABOUT LAB</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[#181715] tracking-tight">
        About Everyday AI Lab
      </h1>
      <p class="font-serif italic text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#E05A2B] mt-2 font-bold">
        日常AI：只聊生活中的 AI，记录普通人的日常实践。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Animated Brand Introduction with 3D Tilt -->
    <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_6px_0_#181715,0_16px_32px_rgba(24,23,21,0.06)] mb-12 bg-[#FAF7F2]">
      <img src="/images/everyday-ai-intro.gif" alt="Everyday AI Lab Animated Intro" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
    </div>

    <!-- Brand Board Visual Preview with 3D Tilt -->
    <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_6px_0_#181715,0_16px_32px_rgba(24,23,21,0.06)] mb-12 bg-[#FAF7F2]">
      <img src="/images/brand-board.jpeg" alt="Everyday AI Lab Brand Visual Board" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
    </div>

    <div class="prose-content">
      <h2>Why We Built This Living Lab</h2>
      <p>
        For the past year, the tech industry has been obsessed with trillion-parameter benchmarks and astronomical funding rounds. But as ordinary humans cooking dinners, managing households, caring for aging parents, and untangling messy schedules, we felt an immense disconnect.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of us don't need a spaceship to reach Mars. We need a reliable Swiss Army knife in our desk drawer or on our kitchen counter.
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        <strong>Our Mission</strong>: Only about AI in real life. Practical experiments for everyday humans. No corporate jargon, just honest dispatches and actionable takeaways.
      </blockquote>

      <h2>Four Core Pillars</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>🧪 Life Labs</strong>: Real-life AI makeovers for daily living, cooking, family, health, and parenting.</li>
        <li><strong>⚡ Workflows</strong>: Zero-code practical productivity and end-to-end skill acquisition loops.</li>
        <li><strong>🧠 Habit Shifts</strong>: Unlearning keyword searching, mastering inquiry, and shifting from memorization to curation.</li>
        <li><strong>🧰 My Stack</strong>: Battle-tested daily AI apps, workflows, and reusable prompt blueprints.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Get in Touch & Collaborations</h2>
      <p>
        Got an everyday AI friction you want us to tackle, or interested in discussions and partnerships? Reach out directly to the editor:
      </p>
      <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 my-4 space-y-3 font-mono text-sm shadow-[0_4px_0_#181715]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>💬</span>
          <strong>WhatsApp</strong>:
          <a 
            href="https://wa.me/15024301078" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="text-[#1E5E3A] font-bold hover:underline"
          >
            +1 (502) 430-1078 (Click to chat)
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>📞</span>
          <strong>Direct Phone</strong>:
          <a href="tel:+15024301078" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">
            +1 (502) 430-1078
          </a>
          <span class="text-xs text-[#8A847A]">(Available for calls & text)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <Newsletter lang="en" />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
